{"id":952240,"shortDescription":"Dieselpunk Wars es un juego de construcción de vehículos, centrado en el combate con mecánicas avanzadas y simulación de daño real. Utiliza más de 300 elementos para construir la máquina de guerra de tus sueños. Construye vehículos que recorran la tierra, surquen los cielos o naveguen bajo el agua.","developers":["Image Power S.A.","Roasted Games"],"publishers":["CreativeForge Games S.A.","PlayWay S.A."],"categories":["Un jugador","Logros de Steam","Steam Workshop","Steam Cloud","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"13 MAY 2021","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/952240/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1782669050","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/952240/ss_7ace9c5bde92eeab41478b8a8b6e7705937b2cf5.600x338.jpg?t=1782669050","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/952240/ss_7ace9c5bde92eeab41478b8a8b6e7705937b2cf5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782669050"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/952240/ss_b8840a7929a1f7fa048716bad6e71dada29d000b.600x338.jpg?t=1782669050","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/952240/ss_b8840a7929a1f7fa048716bad6e71dada29d000b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782669050"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/952240/ss_a7ef26e5e702020d3aa588f9f6f812273a7b4f85.600x338.jpg?t=1782669050","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/952240/ss_a7ef26e5e702020d3aa588f9f6f812273a7b4f85.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782669050"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/952240/ss_8ad109d64a097464f471c4bf2f4cd06ebb581e6c.600x338.jpg?t=1782669050","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/952240/ss_8ad109d64a097464f471c4bf2f4cd06ebb581e6c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782669050"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass